      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Isis era una gran diosa egipcia y una poderosa maga.",
          "en": "Isis was a great Egyptian goddess and a powerful magician."
        },
        {
          "es": "Conocía el nombre secreto de Ra, el dios del sol, y eso la hacía muy poderosa.",
          "en": "She knew the secret name of Ra, the sun god, and that made her very powerful."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero su magia no podía proteger a su esposo Osiris, el rey de Egipto.",
          "en": "But her magic could not protect her husband, Osiris, the king of Egypt."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un dios celoso, Set, planeaba matarlo.",
          "en": "A jealous god, Set, was planning to kill him."
