      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Esa noche hubo un gran banquete en el palacio. Los setenta y dos conspiradores estaban entre los invitados.",
          "en": "That night there was a great banquet at the palace. The seventy-two conspirators were among the guests."
        },
        {
          "es": "Set hizo traer el cofre, y todos los invitados lo miraron asombrados.",
          "en": "Set had the chest carried in, and every guest stared at it in wonder."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Será de quien quepa dentro», dijo Set, como si fuera un juego.",
          "en": "“It will belong to whoever fits inside,” said Set, as if it were a game."
        },
        {
          "es": "Uno por uno, los invitados se acostaron en el cofre, pero no le cabía a ninguno.",
          "en": "One by one the guests lay down in the chest, but it did not fit any of them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces le tocó a Osiris. No sospechaba nada y se acostó dentro.",
          "en": "Then it was Osiris’s turn. He suspected nothing, and he lay down inside."
        }
