        {
          "es": "Esa misma noche los conspiradores llevaron el cofre hasta la orilla del Nilo.",
          "en": "That same night, the conspirators carried the chest to the banks of the Nile."
        },
        {
          "es": "El escritor griego Plutarco dice que era el día diecisiete del mes de Athyr.",
          "en": "The Greek writer Plutarch says it was the seventeenth day of the month of Athyr."
        },
        {
          "es": "Osiris llevaba veintiocho años como rey.",
          "en": "Osiris had been king for twenty-eight years."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tiraron el cofre al agua, y la corriente lo llevó hasta el mar.",
          "en": "They threw the chest into the water, and the current carried it out to sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así terminó el reinado de Osiris sobre los vivos.",
          "en": "That is how Osiris’s rule over the living came to an end."
        }
